    "detailed_description": "SprintLine: A Test of Skill and Patience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into SprintLine, a 3D speed-running platformer designed to challenge and frustrate. Navigate through a labyrinth of obstacles with options to sprint, jump, or wallride. Every level is a new puzzle, testing your reflexes and resolve.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSimple in concept but complex in execution, SprintLine is not just about finishing the course; it's about mastering it. Respawn points are your lifelines, sparingly scattered to keep you sane. Expect hours of gameplay filled with exhilarating highs and testing lows.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPerfect for those who love a tough gaming challenge, SprintLine promises not just a sense of achievement, but a journey of perseverance and grit. Are you ready to take on the challenge?",
